message: 'To cite package "worldhdi" in publications use:'
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'worldhdi: Human Development Index Worldwide 1990-2022 (2024)'
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.14006109
abstract: Provides Human Development Index (HDI) trends from 1990 to 2022 for 195
  countries and territories (193 of them ranked) and 15 UNDP aggregates (development
  groups, regions and the world), from the UNDP Human Development Report 2023/2024
  Statistical Annex. It includes HDI ranks, changes in rank and average annual HDI
  growth.
